// title: LLM Hunting in a MDE Environment
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceFileEvents, ExposureGraphNodes
// purpose: LLM Hunting in a MDE Environment
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/LLM%20Hunting%20in%20a%20MDE%20Environment.kql
